"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 mb-10\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Lisa Thompson\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Add7ab32a241b446b84e0fca7d7d67899R.jpg\"/></div><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Lisa Thompson</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] max-w-xl\">Award-winning landscape designer with 17 years of residential design experience and over 800 completed projects. Holds a B.L.A. in Landscape Architecture from the University of Florida and is a registered Landscape Architect (RLA) in 4 states. Her designs have been featured in Better Homes and Gardens, Southern Living, and the APLD International Design Awards. Pioneered the SmartScape Method for creating beautiful low-maintenance gardens that reduce water usage by up to 60% while increasing property value.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Articles by <!-- -->Lisa Thompson</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/identify-manage-lace-bug-damage-ornamental-trees-shrubs\"><img alt=\"How to Identify &amp; Manage Lace Bug Damage on Ornamental Trees &amp; Shrubs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Acadc9e7a48184eb98f21fb88abb36d0dJ.jpg\"/></a